  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## 0.5.6\n\n### Changed\n\n* Updated the `CanKit.Core` dependency to 0.5.6.\n* Aligned BCM periodic update, query, and delete operations with Linux kernel behavior for Classic CAN and CAN FD frames.\n\n### Fixed\n\n* Periodic transmissions now retain their own frame memory and release native handles and buffers when setup fails.\n* `RemainingCount` now handles asynchronous status replies, finite completion, and infinite jobs without spurious errors.\n* Existing interfaces without controller mode information now fall back to static capabilities while genuine native errors still propagate.\n\n### Breaking Changes\n\n* None.",
